{"id":"86d2ffc4d9622936","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-ef-theorem.md","title":"Ehrenfeucht-Fraïssé Theorem","display":"thm-ef-theorem — Ehrenfeucht-Fraïssé Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-ef-theorem","aliases":["57-thm-ef-theorem"],"display":"thm-ef-theorem — Ehrenfeucht-Fraïssé Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-ef-game]]","[[57-df-n-equivalence]]","[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-ef-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-ef-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ef-theorem — Ehrenfeucht-Fraïssé Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f60efdcc5c3b9010\" href=\"?note=f60efdcc5c3b9010\" title=\"57-df-n-equivalence\">57-df-n-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40a9587a80026ff4\" href=\"?note=40a9587a80026ff4\" title=\"57-df-ef-game\">57-df-ef-game</a> 的有限纯关系语言条件及固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span> 为该文件的递归获胜位置集合。原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> 比较所有开公式的全称赋值真值，故本文件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_n\">\\(G_n\\)</span> 明确表示全部有限初始元组的比较族，而不是仅从空位置出发的通常单局；其 Duplicator 获胜接口如下式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 是本原子下式定义的获胜接口记号，使用全部有限初始元组的比较族及上述递归位置集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_n\">\\(W_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n,W_n\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n,W_n\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[(\\forall\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\exists\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W_n)\\land(\\forall\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W_n)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;[(\\forall\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\exists\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W_n)\\land(\\forall\\vec b\\in B^m\\;\\exists\\vec a\\in A^m\\;\\langle n,\\vec a,\\vec b\\rangle\\in W_n)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\equiv_n\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"f60efdcc5c3b9010","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-n-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"40a9587a80026ff4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[57-df-ef-game]] 的有限纯关系语言条件及固定 $\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$。$W_n$ 为该文件的递归获胜位置集合。原 $\\equiv_n$ 比较所有开公式的全称赋值真值，故本文件 $G_n$ 明确表示全部有限初始元组的比较族，而不是仅从空位置出发的通常单局；其 Duplicator 获胜接口如下式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,n","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"W_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"G_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathr